"""
RedLoop - Learn & practise AI red teaming across the Agile lifecycle with A4SRAI
================================================================================
A self-guided learning tool that teaches the Agile 4 Secure Responsible AI
(A4SRAI) framework, lets learners practise red teaming safely, structure their
findings across the lifecycle, and check their understanding.

Runs fully offline - no API keys, no internet required.

Run:
    pip install -r requirements.txt
    streamlit run app.py

Engineering notes (robust for many concurrent learners):
  * Each browser session has its own st.session_state, so nothing mixes between
    learners.
  * All charts use matplotlib's object-oriented Figure API (no global pyplot
    state) so concurrent renders are thread-safe.
  * The data editor keeps a single source of truth (its widget key + return
    value); the editor's output is never written back into the frame that feeds
    it, which is what previously dropped the first edit in a cell.
"""

